+## Installation
+
+1. Run a **Minecraft 26.3** server with **Fabric Loader 0.20.1 or newer** and **Java 25**.
+2. Put `discord_voice_bridge-1.0.1.jar` in the server's `mods/` folder.
+3. Put **Simple Voice Chat 2.6.27+26.3** (`voicechat-fabric-2.6.27+26.3.jar`) in `mods/` too.
+4. Do **not** install Fabric API separately. The release jar is self-contained: it nests
+   `fabric-api 0.165.0+26.3` and `fabric-permissions-api 0.7.0`. A server that already ships
+   Fabric API is fine as well (Loader resolves to one copy; keep it at 0.165.0+26.3 or newer for 26.3).
+5. Start the server and check the log: Fabric Loader should list `fabric-api`, `voicechat` and
+   `discord_voice_bridge` as loaded mods, with no `which is missing!` line.
+
+Players need the matching **Simple Voice Chat client mod**; this mod itself is server-side only
+(`"environment": "server"`), so clients do not install it.
+
+You also need a Discord bot with the `guild_voice_states` intent whose account can
+`voice_connect` and `voice_receive` in the target voice channel.
+
+### Supported versions
+
+| Component | Supported by this jar | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| Minecraft | **26.3** (26.3.x patches within 26.3) | Declared as `minecraft ~26.3`. Not 1.21.x, not 26.1/26.2. |
+| Fabric Loader | **0.20.1 or newer** | Declared as `fabricloader >=0.20.1`. Older Loaders are rejected before the mod loads. |
+| Java | **25 or newer** | Compiled and published with `--release 25`; Minecraft 26.3 itself needs Java 25. |
+| Fabric API | **0.165.0+26.3, bundled** | No separate download. This is what the jar's `fabric-api` dependency resolves to. |
+| fabric-permissions-api | **0.7.0, bundled** | Nested jar, nothing to install. |
+| Simple Voice Chat | **2.6.27+26.3** on the server | Separate download (not redistributable here). The mod loads without it but logs a warning and cannot bridge audio. |
+| Discord | Any JDA 5.5.1-compatible API | Bot token in `config/discord_voice_bridge/discord_voice_bridge.json`. |
+
+**One jar cannot support every Minecraft version.** Minecraft, Fabric API, Simple Voice Chat and
+the Java baseline all change between game versions, and this mod touches all four (Mojang-mapped
+26.3 classes, `PlayerList.placeNewPlayer` for the TAB mixin, the SVC 2.6.x API and its
+`CommonCompatibilityManager` bootstrap, Java 25 bytecode). Each Minecraft version therefore needs
+its own build against that version's Minecraft, Fabric API, SVC and Java. The table above is the
+complete list of what this artifact supports.
+
+### Troubleshooting
+
+| Error in the log | What it means | Fix |
+|---|---|---|
+| `Mod 'Discord Voice Bridge' (discord_voice_bridge) 1.0.0 requires version 0.165.0 or later of fabric, which is missing!` | **1.0.0 only.** Its `fabric.mod.json` declared a dependency on a mod id called `fabric`. No such mod exists (Fabric API is `fabric-api`; the builtins are `fabricloader`, `minecraft`, `java`), so no install can satisfy it - not even a manual Fabric API install. | Delete the 1.0.0 jar and use **1.0.1 or newer**. Nothing else fixes it. |
+| `... requires version 0.165.0 or later of fabric-api, which is missing!` | The jar you installed has no nested Fabric API (typically the `-dev` jar or a broken build). | Install the release jar from CI/releases, or drop Fabric API 0.165.0+26.3 into `mods/`. |
+| `... requires version ... of minecraft` | Wrong Minecraft version. | Use 26.3. |
+| `... requires version ... of fabricloader` | Fabric Loader older than 0.20.1. | Update the Loader. |
+| `... requires version ... of java` | Server running on Java < 25. | Update Java to 25. |
+| Server starts but the bridge does nothing | SVC missing, invalid token/channel id, or bridge disabled. | Check the log warnings, then `/dvc config`. |
